From a2a93452aac4ac90df236254c1eef9200169799e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 08:42:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 361/369] www: animated model header on the login /
 set-password / logout screens

Add the per-model animated header (MP4, ~400KB, 1920x216) to the four auth
screens, playing once on load and freezing on the last frame, with the existing
static header PNG as the poster/fallback (autoplay muted playsinline, no loop -
muted is required for browser autoplay; degrades to the static PNG if autoplay is
blocked or <video> is unsupported):
  - Main_Login.asp   : replaces the .login_img banner spot (login + logout view)
  - Main_Password.asp: header above the change-password title
  - Reaper_FirstBoot.asp: header above the brand mark (first-boot set password)
  - Logout.asp       : header above the logout message

Asset: www/images/RT-96U_REAPER_Header.mp4 (BE96U). Named parallel to the banner
PNG so the sibling port can treat it as per-model. NOTE: port_sibling_v2 +
_port_protect.sh must be extended to (a) protect *_REAPER_Header.mp4 as per-model,
(b) copy each model's MP4 from reaper-mockups, and (c) re-point the mp4/png refs
in Main_Password/Reaper_FirstBoot/Logout (added to BANNER_REFS) - done before the
fleet fan-out, else siblings would ship the BE96U animation.

Rides v2.2.9 (unbuilt).
